# Soft billing payment notice

## Product rule

- Hard lock only when status is `BLOCKED` (`BillingAccessGuard`).
- Soft notice when `paymentNoticeRequired` (GRACE, or charge due today/overdue with balance &lt; monthly total).
- Slots Asia/Tashkent: **10:00, 15:00, 21:00**. Duration ~12s. Does not block POS.
- On login/open: if any passed slot today was not shown yet → show **once** and mark all pending slots; future slots still fire on schedule.
- One full shift open all day → all three fire. Open at 20:00 with none shown → catch-up for 10+15, then 21:00 separately.
- Admin CTA → `/billing` (or `/rst/admin/billing`). Cashier → support Telegram `@aurent_support` + ask admin.
- Do not show notice on billing pages.

## Do not

- Turn soft notice into a hard overlay that blocks checkout.
- Change slot hours without updating `BILLING_NOTICE_HOURS` + this rule.
